<p class="megacmd-intro">This plugin syncs files between your MEGA cloud storage account and any Unraid share. It uses MEGAcmd, the official command-line client from MEGA. Press the Help button (top right) to see what each section below does.</p>

<p class="megacmd-warning"><strong>CAUTION:</strong> Do not delete the appdata/megacmd folder. This plugin stores its login session and all sync and backup settings there, mostly inside a hidden <code>.megaCmd</code> subfolder. If you delete this folder, MEGAcmd logs you out and removes every sync and backup you have set up. The visible <code>server.log</code> file alone is safe to delete. To check activity without deleting anything, use "View recent logs" below.</p>

