        local folder's contents are correct. If you are not sure why this happened, check
        the local folder before you self-heal.
      </p>
      <form class="megacmd-ajax-form" method="post">
        <input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<?=$var['csrf_token']?>">
        <input type="hidden" name="action" value="selfhealsync">
