    icon, plus email if you have email notifications on. You can turn each notification
    type on or off. The watchdog checks in at the interval you choose here. At each
    check, it does these tasks:
    <ul>
      <li>Restart the background service if it crashes (when that setting is on)</li>
      <li>Reapply file and folder permissions</li>
      <li>Check for sync or login problems</li>
      <li>Protect sync folders from Unraid's mover</li>
    </ul>
    Permissions control what MEGAcmd sets on newly created files and folders. Speed limits
    cap how much of your internet connection MEGAcmd can use, so a big sync or backup
    does not slow down everything else on your network.
  </blockquote>
</div>

</div>

<? if ($message !== ""): ?>
<div class="megacmd-box">
  <h3>Last command output</h3>
